["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Lintel Conquest of UNIX Lintel GPL Active Directory IA-64 / Itanium distro\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-asianometry-打垮-unix-的不是-windows-而是-intel-扶持的-linux/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c89d1667eef4960d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>打垮 UNIX 的不是 Windows,而是 Intel 扶持的 Linux</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">UNIX 阵营靠专有硬件和操作系统把客户锁死多年，Intel 先用 Windows NT 撬开缺口，但真正要命的是免费、能看源码、不怕被锁死的 Linux。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Linux</span><span class=\"tag\">UNIX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An 86-minute guide to finding PMF | Rob Snyder (Author, The Power of Pull) PULL framework Hail Mary question Goblin mode Design partner\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-lennys-好产品不是说服出来的-是发现客户已经卡住的那件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de7a163b06c13a51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>好产品不是说服出来的，是发现客户已经卡住的那件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人常以为要靠说服让客户买单，Rob的核心论断是：拉力早就存在于客户的待办清单里，你的工作只是去发现那个会把产品从你手里抢走的人，而不是创造渴望。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品市场契合</span><span class=\"tag\">早期销售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Podcast: Kimi K3.1 Pro, the new cyber reality, and Muse musings astroturfing abliterated model B300 / NVL72 PHP2Shell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-interconnects-php漏洞公开后无人作恶-网络安全瓶颈不是ai而是没人打补丁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0c99c5f34972836e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>PHP漏洞公开后无人作恶：网络安全瓶颈不是AI而是没人打补丁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi主动压低自身攻击能力以示负责；PHP高危漏洞曝光后预期的大规模黑客利用并未出现——瓶颈是企业几年不打补丁，而非AI能力强弱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1369: Florida Model Makes Measles Great Again VHIT (vaccine-induced herd immunity threshold) vaccination reproduction number (R_v) HLA class I CTL epitope founder effect escape mutation / epitope variant\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-twiv-佛州还没取消疫苗强制令-麻疹就已经跌破群体免疫线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:57:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>佛州还没取消疫苗强制令，麻疹就已经跌破群体免疫线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">佛州儿童疫苗接种率只有91.6%,已经低于阻断麻疹所需阈值；取消强制令后接种率或跌到82%,麻疹将在十年内变成持续50年的地方病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Malcolm Gaskill on Why Our Ancestors Weren&#x27;t as Superstitious as We Think pareidolia confessional state\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-goodfight-两百年猎巫审判仅十一万起-启蒙运动后数字才被夸大到百万/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>两百年猎巫审判仅十一万起，启蒙运动后数字才被夸大到百万</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真实的猎巫审判记录显示，十六至十七世纪欧洲审判约十一万起，陪审团常以证据不足拒绝定罪——这幅画面远比「集体疯狂」复杂，也远比后世想象的温和。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">猎巫审判</span><span class=\"tag\">启蒙运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a Chicago Restaurant Has Stayed Open For Nearly Three Decades farm-to-table ghost kitchen shared kitchen prix fixe GLP-1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-oddlots-独立高端餐厅行业-整体回报率是负的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>独立高端餐厅行业，整体回报率是负的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开了近30年高端餐厅的老板说，独立餐饮没有护城河、谁都能抄配方，守法经营还要比同行多付5%到10%成本，行业整体回报因此是负的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐饮</span><span class=\"tag\">小生意经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Cyber Panic, Ken Griffin&#x27;s Bubble Warning, The Fall of France? PHP to shell virtual patch bond vigilantes Obliteration AI chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-allin-ai支出的90-来自1-的公司-八成是亏损的创业公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9af963e06c2ea01b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>AI支出的90%来自1%的公司，八成是亏损的创业公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">钱从VC流向创业公司，创业公司把钱花在AI上做出营收，再回头找VC加轮融资——这是闭环，不是真实扩散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Embracing the Bond Market: Masters in Business with Robin Wigglesworth Consols Sukuk Securitization Bearer bond CBO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-mastersinbiz-ai-泡沫本身不可怕-可怕的是它越来越靠发债撑着/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>AI 泡沫本身不可怕，可怕的是它越来越靠发债撑着</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">历史数据显示，由股权推动的泡沫破裂后经济影响有限，由信贷推动的泡沫破裂才真正伤筋动骨，而今年AI超大厂商发债规模已从2000亿美元跳到5000亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">债券市场</span><span class=\"tag\">美国国债</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI越强大，人为什么越累｜钦文对话马兆远 Testing Knowledge\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-效率翻倍后是早下班还是裁员加班-决定了技术会不会让人更累/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fc78e021049c424-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">25:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">王钦文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>效率翻倍后是早下班还是裁员加班，决定了技术会不会让人更累</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗素百年前问过同一个问题：工厂效率提高一倍后，是分享给工人更多休息，还是裁掉一半人、逼剩下的人加班自保，AI不过是这道选择题的最新版本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">教育改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Democratizing Security for the Agentic Web with Cloudflare CTO Dane Knecht CVE WebPKI Zero Trust AEO X402 CPM/CTM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-nopriors-cdn巨头cto预言-未来18个月一半工程时间要用来补漏洞/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/44db1fd0a7b5258a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">41:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>CDN巨头CTO预言：未来18个月一半工程时间要用来补漏洞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">漏洞披露速度从一年一次变成每周多次，连TLS信任根密钥都曾被人用种子数字4破解——CTO说未来18个月，一半工程资源要砸向安全。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Netflix Angst, The End of the Internet, Q&amp;A on Meta’s VR Glasses, Anthropic Alignment, You Can See Everything elliptical curve cryptography zero trust generative UI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-sharptech-广告模式能无限涨价不流失用户-订阅模式做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>广告模式能无限涨价不流失用户，订阅模式做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">广告定价能随算法变准持续上涨、不影响用户留存；订阅涨价一旦引发流失就晚了——这正是奈飞参与度下滑、广告营收目标又没达标时真正该慌的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">奈飞</span><span class=\"tag\">广告变现</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"反地产逻辑，为什么成就了阿那亚｜钦文对话马寅\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路-不是战略远见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f06d53df338a0f19-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">28:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王钦文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路，不是战略远见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马寅说如果2012年还能像别的开发商一样快进快出赚快钱，他绝不会死磕阿那亚——是十亿贷款和只剩这一个项目的绝境，逼出了这套反地产逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">长期主义</span><span class=\"tag\">社区运营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"重新定义个人电脑，老黄到底凭什么？RTX Spark深度解析 PRISM MXC Windows on ARM PAIR Prefill/Decode MOE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-laoshi-rtx-spark芯片没变-英伟达要的不是性能而是pc定义权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">老</div><span class=\"dur\">24:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>RTX Spark芯片没变，英伟达要的不是性能而是PC定义权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这颗芯片几乎就是去年发布的DGX Spark换了操作系统，老黄真正想要的不是跑分赢家，而是把CPU、GPU、内存、系统捆成一套只认英伟达规则的PC新架构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">CUDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cure to Founder Burnout Isn&#x27;t Rest | 6 Solo Founders swallow the frog chief of staff\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-solofounders-创始人倦怠的解药不是休息-而是重新找到动力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/18d01623f9e39d48-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>创始人倦怠的解药不是休息，而是重新找到动力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在Lindy熬了两年多后，Flo以为自己需要半年假期才能恢复，但真正让他走出倦怠的，是重新找到动力的那一刻，精力几乎立刻就回来了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创始人倦怠</span><span class=\"tag\">独自创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI lab staff: Has your project been overtaken by events? 8 strategic updates | Rob Wiblin RSI (recursive self-improvement) CoT monitoring Overton window eval awareness mech interp model organism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-eightythousand-ai员工能拖慢失控进程-但这份议价权正在快速清零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d87b66f6770249f5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">14:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>AI员工能拖慢失控进程，但这份议价权正在快速清零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">技术员工能靠罢工式不配合为对齐研究拖出时间，但这种杠杆只在公司还离不开他们时成立——一旦模型自动化了他们的工作，这份权力就会归零，所以能用就得现在用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">递归自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Unearthed! in October 2026, Part 2 borrow pit maquette clinker-built\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-stuffmissed-中国壁画两千年不褪色-秘密是血液而非颜料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>中国壁画两千年不褪色，秘密是血液而非颜料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">左江花山岩画两千年保持鲜红，科学分析发现颜料用石灰浆混血液作粘合剂，部分血液来自产后女性，可能带有母系社会的仪式意味。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">沉船</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Missing Infrastructure for AI Agents: Documents | Reducto’s Adit Abraham VLM IDP harness recall\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-a16z-大模型处理长文档最容易犯的错-是悄悄漏掉信息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">38:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>大模型处理长文档最容易犯的错，是悄悄漏掉信息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">权威基准测试发现，顶尖大模型抽取长文档时精确率很高，但会不动声色地漏掉信息，这种错误在生产环境里几乎无法被发现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文档处理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Robinson on What It Looks Like When a State is Failing extractive institutions inclusive institutions creative destruction monopsony critical juncture\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-oddlots-诺奖得主断言-中国经济迟早要为政治集权买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">37:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>诺奖得主断言：中国经济迟早要为政治集权买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他认为中国增长靠的是经济从汲取性转向包容性制度，但政治权力从未被制衡——权力导致腐败、绝对权力导致绝对腐败，这决定了增长终将脱轨，只是时间问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制度经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Broomology (BROOMS) with Cate O’Connell-Richards besom broomcorn johnny flying ointment broom squire Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-ologies-女巫飞天传说的真实来源-致幻药膏涂在扫帚柄上使用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>女巫飞天传说的真实来源：致幻药膏涂在扫帚柄上使用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓女巫骑扫帚飞天，脱胎自她们把含致幻生物碱的药膏涂抹在扫帚柄上、经粘膜吸收产生的飞行幻觉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民俗史</span><span class=\"tag\">手工艺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI for the Fortune 2000: How Tenex Builds an AI-Native SDLC — Alex Lieberman &amp; CJ Hess MetaHarness FDE (forward deployed engineer) RBAC AMP Kill My SaaS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-latentspace-多数企业用上了ai聊天-但智能体真正投产的不到5/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9a3ee5d13ee0cdf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>多数企业用上了AI聊天，但智能体真正投产的不到5%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企业给员工装上Claude和Codex很容易，90%已经做了；但把智能体真正部署进生产、干非工程的活，只有5%做到——这中间的落差才是这期的核心数据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI落地</span><span class=\"tag\">按产出付薪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"155. 和科沃斯钱程聊，父与子、企二代接班的样本与肌理、机器人，和我内心的追寻 physical AI FSD repetition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-zhangxiaojun-29岁当上科沃斯ceo-他说那是愚昧之巅不是人生巅峰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/655ca401e97f9e11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>29岁当上科沃斯CEO,他说那是愚昧之巅不是人生巅峰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他接任CEO时以为到达人生巅峰，后来才明白那是一次史诗级错判：战略方向全对，却因为不懂公司怎么做决策，两三年都没把自己和组织的神经接上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企二代接班</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"#887: Q&amp;A with Tim — The 4-Hour Workweek in a World of AI, Rebuilding Personal Agency, The 4-Hour Body After 40, and More DEAL framework Oryx red teaming accelerated TMS vagal nerve stimulation Gymnastic Strength Training (GST)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-timferriss-ai不会省时间-只会把垃圾工作做得更快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>AI不会省时间，只会把垃圾工作做得更快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">没有先定义和砍掉该做的事，AI只是加速器：它不会创造闲暇，只会把琐碎、无关紧要的任务放大成更多工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人效率</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Programmable Data Center — Evan Conrad, SF Compute physical settlement cash settlement basis risk order book backplane InfiniBand fabric\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-latentspace-英伟达造不出算力期货市场-因为做了就得放弃自己的推理生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/74ca452fc18a3198-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">36:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达造不出算力期货市场：因为做了就得放弃自己的推理生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有手握算力供给的玩家都有自己的生意要保护，只有彻底放弃推理和云业务、只做中立撮合的人，才能让这个价格被所有人信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力交易</span><span class=\"tag\">物理结算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Marriott on the End of Reading Reading Revolution Republic of Letters ethnolinguistic fractionalization post-literate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-goodfight-识字真正训练的不是知识-而是把情绪逐出说理的能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>识字真正训练的不是知识，而是把情绪逐出说理的能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马里奥特认为，识字真正的作用是把魅力、情绪等非理性说服手段逐出公共说理；读写衰退，意味着靠人格和情绪煽动的政治正卷土重来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阅读衰退</span><span class=\"tag\">识字与民主</span>\n</div></div></a>"]